{"id":"67878c489c142244","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/773_Gödel_三值逻辑_G_3.md","title":"773 Gödel 三值逻辑 G 3","display":"773_Gödel_三值逻辑_G_3","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"773-Gödel-三值逻辑-G_3\">773 Gödel 三值逻辑 G_3</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B,A\\to B\">\\(p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B,A\\to B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.1-原子公式\">2.1 原子公式</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.2-底常元\">2.2 底常元</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"2.3-否定公式\">2.3 否定公式</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.4-合取公式\">2.4 合取公式</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\">\\(\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.5-析取公式\">2.5 析取公式</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\">\\(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.6-蕴含公式\">2.6 蕴含公式</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{G_3}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{G_3}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{G_3}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{G_3}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}_{G_3}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{G_3}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{G_3}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{G_3}\\)</span>，记\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma=\\operatorname{Ext}_{G_3}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma=\\operatorname{Ext}_{G_3}(\\sigma)\\)</span>；它满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统无绑定构造子；相应函数与关系的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{G_3}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,G_3}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{G_3}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,G_3}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{G_3}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,G_3}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{G_3}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,G_3}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-Gödel-三值矩阵\">4. Gödel 三值矩阵</h1>\n<p>真值集合与指定值集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_{G_3}=\\{0,\\tfrac12,1\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{G_3}=\\{1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf V_{G_3}=\\{0,\\tfrac12,1\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{G_3}=\\{1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>底常元解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{G_3}=0\">\\(\\bot_{G_3}=0\\)</span>。语义运算的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{G_3}:\\mathsf V_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf V_{G_3},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{G_3}:\\mathsf V_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf V_{G_3},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_{G_3},\\vee_{G_3},\\Rightarrow_{G_3}:\n\\mathsf V_{G_3}\\times\\mathsf V_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf V_{G_3}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\wedge_{G_3},\\vee_{G_3},\\Rightarrow_{G_3}:\n\\mathsf V_{G_3}\\times\\mathsf V_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf V_{G_3}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逐点定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{G_3}a=\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;a=0,\\\\\n0,&amp;a\\ne 0,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{G_3}a=\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;a=0,\\\\\n0,&amp;a\\ne 0,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge_{G_3}b=\\min(a,b),\n\\qquad\na\\vee_{G_3}b=\\max(a,b),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge_{G_3}b=\\min(a,b),\n\\qquad\na\\vee_{G_3}b=\\max(a,b),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\Rightarrow_{G_3}b=\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;a\\le b,\\\\\nb,&amp;a&gt;b.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\Rightarrow_{G_3}b=\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;a\\le b,\\\\\nb,&amp;a&gt;b.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-赋值、公式值与反例证书\">5. 赋值、公式值与反例证书</h1>\n<p>赋值集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{G_3}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf V_{G_3}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{G_3}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf V_{G_3}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf V_{G_3}\">\\(\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf V_{G_3}\\)</span> 由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{bot})=\\bot_{G_3},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{bot})=\\bot_{G_3},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{G_3}\\overline v(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{G_3}\\overline v(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{G_3}\\overline v(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{G_3}\\overline v(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{G_3}\\overline v(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{G_3}\\overline v(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\Rightarrow_{G_3}\\overline v(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\Rightarrow_{G_3}\\overline v(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>反例证书函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{G_3}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{G_3}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{G_3}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{G_3}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{G_3}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{G_3}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{G_3})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{G_3}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{G_3}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{G_3}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{G_3})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{G_3}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-语义后承\">6. 语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{G_3}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{G_3}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{G_3}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{G_3}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{G_3}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{G_3}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{G_3}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{G_3}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubRule}_{G_3}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{G_3}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SubRule}_{G_3}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{G_3}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-语义证书与证明对象排除\">7. 语义证书与证明对象排除</h1>\n<p>语义证书载体函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{G_3}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{G_3}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\)</span>，定义语义证书载体：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{G_3}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{G_3}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{G_3}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{G_3}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{G_3}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{G_3}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{G_3}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{G_3}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{G_3}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{G_3}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显式性约束：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{G_3}\">\\(\\mathsf{Valid}_{G_3}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{G_3}\">\\(\\Vdash_{G_3}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{G_3}\">\\(\\mathsf{SemCert}_{G_3}\\)</span> 均由本文件的真值集合、指定值集合、赋值扩张和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{G_3}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fail}_{G_3}\\)</span> 定义；不引用外部代数类、公式类或命名基逻辑。</p>\n<p>形式证明规则关系的类型及取值声明为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{G_3}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{G_3}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{G_3}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{G_3}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本条目是三值 Gödel 矩阵语义后承系统；不定义 Hilbert 公理集合、证明序列或由规则生成的可证关系。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个语义形式系统\">8. 整个语义形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{G_3}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3},\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3},\\operatorname{BV}_{G_3},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{G_3},\\operatorname{Ext}_{G_3},\\equiv_{\\alpha,G_3},\n\\mathsf V_{G_3},\\mathsf D_{G_3},\\bot_{G_3},\n\\neg_{G_3},\\wedge_{G_3},\\vee_{G_3},\\Rightarrow_{G_3},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{G_3},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{G_3},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{G_3},\n\\Vdash_{G_3},\\mathsf{Valid}_{G_3},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{G_3},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{G_3}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{G_3}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3},\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{G_3},\\operatorname{BV}_{G_3},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{G_3},\\operatorname{Ext}_{G_3},\\equiv_{\\alpha,G_3},\n\\mathsf V_{G_3},\\mathsf D_{G_3},\\bot_{G_3},\n\\neg_{G_3},\\wedge_{G_3},\\vee_{G_3},\\Rightarrow_{G_3},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{G_3},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{G_3},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{G_3},\n\\Vdash_{G_3},\\mathsf{Valid}_{G_3},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{G_3},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{G_3}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统的目标差异是三值 Gödel 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\Rightarrow_{G_3}b=1\">\\(a\\Rightarrow_{G_3}b=1\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\le b\">\\(a\\le b\\)</span>，否则为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>；该条目只定义语义后承、反例证书和代换保持关系，不含 Łukasiewicz 蕴含或证明演算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"773-Gödel-三值逻辑-G_3","text":"773 Gödel 三值逻辑 G_3","level":1},{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"2.1-原子公式","text":"2.1 原子公式","level":2},{"id":"2.2-底常元","text":"2.2 底常元","level":2},{"id":"2.3-否定公式","text":"2.3 否定公式","level":2},{"id":"2.4-合取公式","text":"2.4 合取公式","level":2},{"id":"2.5-析取公式","text":"2.5 析取公式","level":2},{"id":"2.6-蕴含公式","text":"2.6 蕴含公式","level":2},{"id":"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-Gödel-三值矩阵","text":"4. Gödel 三值矩阵","level":1},{"id":"5.-赋值、公式值与反例证书","text":"5. 赋值、公式值与反例证书","level":1},{"id":"6.-语义后承","text":"6. 语义后承","level":1},{"id":"7.-语义证书与证明对象排除","text":"7. 语义证书与证明对象排除","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个语义形式系统","text":"8. 整个语义形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}.","display":true},{"tex":"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B,A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{G_3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{G_3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in